# Pairs with BackupSagaConsistent (the requested GateLapse). The gate lease
# lapses mid-capture and the release does not validate that its token was
# held throughout, so a decision recorded after the lapse - and the terminal
# it licenses - lands in a capture whose other shards resolved the saga
# against the snapshot taken before it.
MODULE: BackupSagaConsistentGateLapse
TARGET: BackupSagaConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the capture is accepted without validating that the gate was held throughout
PERTURBS: Validate

--- FIND
    /\ IF /\ \A T \in Members : held[T]
          /\ kind = "set" => \A T \in Members : epoch[T] = before[T]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the lease is not validated.
    /\ IF /\ kind = "set" => \A T \in Members : epoch[T] = before[T]
--- END
